8	 * of strings before showing any feedback.
9	 *
10	 * Logs incremental per-file progress by phase and locale:
11	 *   📋 Building locale-specific API docs
12	 *   🔨 Generating EN API docs
13	 *     ✓ TypeDoc output
14	 *     ✓ API badge styling
15	 *     ✓ Overview cards
